#. Translators: Shown when a favourite saved as a network stream is not a web address.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:129
msgid "Generic stream link must start with http or https."
msgstr "El enlace de transmisión genérico debe comenzar con http o https."

#. Translators: Shown when a favourite saved as a video, playlist or combined link is not a
#. YouTube address.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:146
msgid "The link must be a valid YouTube link for this type."
msgstr "El enlace debe ser un enlace válido de YouTube para este tipo."

#. Translators: Shown when a favourite saved as a video does not name one.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:153
msgid "Video favorites require a YouTube video link."
msgstr "Los favoritos de video requieren un enlace de video de YouTube."

#. Translators: Shown when a favourite saved as a playlist does not name one.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:157
msgid "Playlist favorites require a YouTube playlist link."
msgstr ""
"Los favoritos de listas de reproducción requieren un enlace de lista de "
"reproducción de YouTube."

#. Translators: Shown when a favourite saved as a combined link does not carry both a video
#. and a playlist.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:162
msgid ""
"Combined link favorites require a link containing both video and playlist."
msgstr ""
"Los favoritos de enlaces combinados requieren un enlace que contenga tanto "
"el video como la lista de reproducción."

#. Translators: The kind of a saved favourite: a single YouTube video.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:173
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

#. Translators: The kind of a saved favourite: a YouTube playlist.
#. Translators: Marks a row in the results list as a playlist rather than a single video.
#. Translators: Search filter: return playlists rather than videos.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:175 UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:319
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:74
msgid "Playlist"
msgstr "Lista de reproducción"

#. Translators: The kind of a saved favourite: a YouTube link naming both a video and a playlist.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:177
msgid "Combined link"
msgstr "Enlace combinado"

#. Translators: The kind of a saved favourite: a web address played as a stream.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:179
msgid "Generic stream"
msgstr "Transmisión genérica"

#. Translators: Shown when the user edits or removes a favourite that is no longer saved.
#: Favorites/FavoriteStore.cs:193
msgid "That favorite is no longer saved."
msgstr "Ese favorito ya no está guardado."

#. Translators: Shown when an IPTV source's address is not a web address. "http" and
#. "https" are protocol names and are not translated.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:116
msgid "The address must start with http or https."
msgstr "La dirección debe comenzar con http o https."

#. Translators: Shown when the user saves a file-based IPTV source without choosing a file.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:124
msgid "A playlist file is required."
msgstr "Se requiere un archivo de lista de reproducción."

#. Translators: Shown when an Xtream IPTV source is saved without a username and password.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:133
msgid "Xtream sources need a username and password."
msgstr "Las fuentes Xtream necesitan un nombre de usuario y una contraseña."

#. Translators: Shown when a Stalker portal IPTV source is saved without a MAC address.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:139
msgid "Stalker sources need a MAC address."
msgstr "Las fuentes Stalker necesitan una dirección MAC."

#. Translators: The kind of an IPTV source: an extended M3U playlist at a web address.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:150
msgid "M3U web address"
msgstr "Dirección web M3U"

#. Translators: The kind of an IPTV source: an extended M3U playlist file on this computer.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:152
msgid "M3U file"
msgstr "Archivo M3U"

#. Translators: The kind of an IPTV source: a provider portal using the Xtream Codes API.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:154
msgid "Xtream Codes"
msgstr "Xtream Codes"

#. Translators: The kind of an IPTV source: a set-top-box portal using the Stalker protocol.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:156
msgid "Stalker portal"
msgstr "Portal Stalker"

#. Translators: Shown when the user edits or removes an IPTV source that is no longer saved.
#: Iptv/IptvSourceStore.cs:167
msgid "That IPTV source is no longer saved."
msgstr "Esa fuente IPTV ya no está guardada."

#: Iptv/PlaylistReader.cs:34 Media/M3uPlaylist.cs:36
msgid "The playlist file is too large."
msgstr "El archivo de lista de reproducción es demasiado grande."

#: Iptv/PlaylistReader.cs:56 Iptv/PlaylistReader.cs:66 Media/M3uPlaylist.cs:55
#: Media/M3uPlaylist.cs:65
msgid "The network playlist is too large."
msgstr "La lista de reproducción de red es demasiado grande."

#: Iptv/PlaylistReader.cs:77 Media/M3uPlaylist.cs:76
msgid "The playlist request timed out."
msgstr ""
"Se agotó el tiempo de espera de la solicitud de la lista de reproducción."

#. Translators: Shown when a Stalker portal's address cannot be understood.
#: Iptv/Stalker/StalkerClient.cs:38
msgid "The Stalker portal address is not valid."
msgstr "La dirección del portal Stalker no es válida."

#. Translators: Shown when a Stalker portal does not return a token, so it cannot be used.
#: Iptv/Stalker/StalkerClient.cs:46
msgid "The Stalker portal did not accept this MAC address."
msgstr "El portal Stalker no aceptó esta dirección MAC."

#. Translators: Shown when talking to a Stalker portal took too long and was given up on.
#: Iptv/Stalker/StalkerClient.cs:75
msgid "The Stalker portal did not respond in time."
msgstr "El portal Stalker no respondió a tiempo."

#. Translators: Shown when an Xtream IPTV source's server address cannot be understood.
#: Iptv/Xtream/XtreamClient.cs:29
msgid "The Xtream server address is not valid."
msgstr "La dirección del servidor Xtream no es válida."

#. Translators: Shown when an Xtream panel rejects the saved username or password.
#: Iptv/Xtream/XtreamClient.cs:40
msgid "The Xtream server rejected the username or password."
msgstr "El servidor Xtream rechazó el nombre de usuario o la contraseña."

#. Translators: Shown when an Xtream account is no longer active (expired, disabled or banned).
#: Iptv/Xtream/XtreamClient.cs:44
msgid "This Xtream account is not active."
msgstr "Esta cuenta de Xtream no está activa."

#. Translators: Shown when talking to an Xtream server took too long and was given up on.
#: Iptv/Xtream/XtreamClient.cs:68
msgid "The Xtream server did not respond in time."
msgstr "El servidor Xtream no respondió a tiempo."

#. Translators: Shown when the user asks the player to open its file types but the system is not Windows.
#: Media/Associations.cs:24 Media/Associations.cs:52
msgid "File associations are available only on Windows."
msgstr "Las asociaciones de archivos solo están disponibles en Windows."

#: Media/MediaConverter.cs:342
msgid "The file could not be converted."
msgstr "No se pudo convertir el archivo."

#: Media/MediaConverter.cs:344
msgid "Unsupported file type."
msgstr "Tipo de archivo no compatible."

#: Media/MediaConverter.cs:346
msgid "The file could not be found."
msgstr "No se pudo encontrar el archivo."

#: Media/MediaConverter.cs:348
msgid "Access to the file was denied."
msgstr "Se denegó el acceso al archivo."

#: Media/MediaConverter.cs:350
msgid "There is not enough free disk space."
msgstr "No hay suficiente espacio libre en el disco."

#. Translators: Shown when recording was asked for with nothing to record from.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:65
msgid "There is nothing to record from."
msgstr "No hay ninguna fuente desde la que grabar."

#. Translators: Shown when every source failed to open, so there was nothing left to record.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:67
msgid "None of the recording sources could be opened."
msgstr "No se pudo abrir ninguna de las fuentes de grabación."

#. Translators: Shown when the folder recordings are saved into could not be used.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:69
msgid "Could not write to the recordings folder."
msgstr "No se pudo escribir en la carpeta de grabaciones."

#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:73
msgid ""
"This format cannot be recorded at the chosen sample rate and channel count."
msgstr ""
"Este formato no se puede grabar con la frecuencia de muestreo y cantidad de "
"canales seleccionadas."

#. Translators: Shown when recording went wrong in a way the player cannot explain more precisely.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:75
msgid "Could not record."
msgstr "No se pudo grabar."

#. Translators: Shown when a recording source was left without a name.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:95
msgid "Give this source a name."
msgstr "Asigna un nombre a esta fuente."

#. Translators: Shown when a recording source is set to capture a program but none was chosen.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:101
msgid "Choose a program to capture."
msgstr "Elige un programa para capturar."

#. Translators: How a microphone or line-in source is described in the recording sources list.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:119
msgid "input device"
msgstr "dispositivo de entrada"

#. Translators: How a source that captures everything a speaker plays is described in the list.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:121
msgid "system output"
msgstr "salida del sistema"

#. Translators: How a source that captures everything except one program is described.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:126
msgid "everything except {program}; PID: {pid}"
msgstr "todo excepto {program}; PID: {pid}"

#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:127
msgid "program {program}; PID: {pid}"
msgstr "programa {program}; PID: {pid}"

#. Translators: One row of the recording sources list. {name} is what the user called the source,
#. {kind} says what it captures and {volume} is a percentage.
#: Recording/RecordingSources.cs:131
msgid "{name} - {kind} - {volume}%"
msgstr "{name} - {kind} - {volume}%"

#. Translators: Title of the window containing Luna Player's version and website.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:16
msgid "About Luna Player"
msgstr "Acerca de Luna Player"

#. Translators: Description in the Luna Player About window.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:22
msgid ""
"Luna Player is a fast, accessible media player for Windows. It is designed "
"for effortless keyboard control and a clear screen-reader experience, and "
"plays local media, network streams, and YouTube content without getting in "
"your way."
msgstr ""
"Luna Player es un reproductor multimedia rápido y accesible para Windows. "
"Está diseñado para controlarse fácilmente mediante el teclado y ofrecer una "
"experiencia clara con lectores de pantalla, reproduciendo contenido local, "
"transmisiones de red y YouTube de forma fluida."

#. Translators: Additional description in the Luna Player About window.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:26
msgid "Luna Player is free and open-source software."
msgstr "Luna Player es software libre y de código abierto."

#. Translators: Third-party copyright and licensing information in the About window. mpv and
#. python-mpv are project names and should not be translated. NOTICE.txt and licenses are names
#. found in Luna's installation folder.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:30
msgid ""
"Luna includes mpv, copyright © the mpv developers and contributors to "
"MPlayer and mplayer2, and a C# translation of python-mpv, copyright © "
"2017-2024 Sebastian Götte. These components are licensed under the GNU "
"Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. FFmpeg is licensed "
"under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or later. See "
"NOTICE.txt and the licenses folder for complete third-party notices and "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Luna incluye mpv, copyright © los desarrolladores de mpv y colaboradores de "
"MPlayer y mplayer2, y una traducción a C# de python-mpv, copyright © "
"2017-2024Sebastian Götte. Estos componentes están licenciados bajo la "
"Licencia Pública General Reducida de GNU, versión 2.1 o posterior. FFmpeg "
"está licenciado bajo la Licencia Pública General Reducida de GNU, versión 3 "
"o posterior. Consulta NOTICE.txt y la carpeta de licencias para ver los "
"avisos y términos completos de terceros."

#. Translators: Final two lines in the About window. {publisher} is the developer's name and
#. {version} is the installed application version.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:37
msgid ""
"Copyright © 2026 {publisher}\n"
"Version: {version}"
msgstr ""
"Copyright © 2026 {publisher}\n"
"Versión: {version}"

#. Translators: Link in the About window that opens the Luna Player project website.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:45
msgid "Visit the Luna Player website"
msgstr "Visitar el sitio web de Luna Player"

#. Translators: The button that accepts a window and carries the change out.
#. Translators: The button that confirms a choice.
#: UI/AboutDialog.cs:48 UI/GoToTimeDialog.cs:66 UI/SleepTimerDialog.cs:164
#: UI/YouTube/QualitySelectionDialog.cs:46
msgid "OK"
msgstr "Aceptar"

#. Translators: Title of the window offering a newer Luna Player release.
#: UI/AppUpdateDialog.cs:15
msgid "New version detected"
msgstr "Nueva versión detectada"

#: UI/AppUpdateDialog.cs:21
msgid ""
"A new version of Luna is available. Your current version is {current}. "
"Available version: {available}. Would you like to update?"
msgstr ""
"Hay una nueva versión de Luna disponible. Tu versión actual es {current}. "
"Versión disponible: {available}. ¿quieres actualizar?"

#. Translators: Label above the list of changes in a new Luna Player release.
#: UI/AppUpdateDialog.cs:26
msgid "What's new"
msgstr "Novedades"

#. Translators: Button that downloads and installs the offered Luna Player release.
#: UI/AppUpdateDialog.cs:34
msgid "Update"
msgstr "Actualizar"

#. Translators: Button that dismisses an available update without installing it.
#: UI/AppUpdateDialog.cs:37
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Más tarde"

#. Translators: Title of the window listing the sound cards the player can send its sound to.
#: UI/AudioDeviceDialog.cs:15
msgid "Sound Cards"
msgstr "Tarjetas de sonido"

#. Translators: Label above the list of sound cards the player can send its sound to.
#: UI/AudioDeviceDialog.cs:19
msgid "Select sound card"
msgstr "Seleccionar tarjeta de sonido"

#. Translators: Spoken description of the Audio settings page, read when the page is opened.
#. Translators: Spoken description of the General settings page, read when the page is opened.
#. Translators: Spoken description of the Recording settings page, read when the page is opened.
#. Translators: Spoken description of the YouTube settings page, read when the page is opened.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:23 UI/GeneralPreferences.cs:24
#: UI/RecordingPreferences.cs:43 UI/YouTube/Preferences.cs:45
msgid ""
"Move through this page with Tab or Shift+Tab. Press F1 while a control is "
"focused to hear what it changes."
msgstr ""
"Desplázate por esta página con Tab o Mayús+Tab. Presiona F1 cuando un "
"control tenga el foco para escuchar qué cambia."

#. Translators: Label of the box holding the seek amount used by the "Custom value" seek step, in seconds.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:29
msgid "Custom seek value (seconds)"
msgstr "Valor de salto personalizado (segundos)"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how much faster or slower one press of the speed keys makes the file play.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:32
msgid "Speed step"
msgstr "Paso de velocidad"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how many semitones one press of a pitch key changes the sound.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:35
msgid "Pitch step (semitones)"
msgstr "Paso de tono (semitonos)"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how much louder or quieter one press of the volume keys makes the sound.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:38
msgid "Volume step"
msgstr "Paso de volumen"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how far one press moves the sound left or right.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:41
msgid "Pan step (percent)"
msgstr "Paso de balance (porcentaje)"

#. Translators: Label of the list that chooses what the player does when it reaches the end of a file.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:44
msgid "What happens after a file ends?"
msgstr "¿Qué sucede después de que finaliza un archivo?"

#. Translators: One of the things the player can do at the end of a file: play the next one.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:47
msgid "Advance to the next file"
msgstr "Avanzar al siguiente archivo"

#. Translators: One of the things the player can do at the end of a file: play the same one again.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:49
msgid "Loop the file"
msgstr "Repetir el archivo en bucle"

#. Translators: One of the things the player can do at the end of a file: stop there.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:51
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "No hacer nada"

#. Translators: Tick box on the Audio settings page: after the last file, carry on from the first one again.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:53
msgid "Wrap to top for multiple files"
msgstr "Volver al principio al llegar al final de la lista"

#. Translators: Tick box on the Audio settings page: remember where each file was stopped and start there again.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:55
msgid "Save current position for each file"
msgstr "Guardar la posición actual para cada archivo"

#. Translators: Tick box on the Audio settings page: even out the loudness and hold back the loudest peaks.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:57
msgid "Enable dynamic normalize and limiter"
msgstr "Activar normalizador dinámico y limitador"

#. Translators: Tick box on the Audio settings page: play the left and right channels mixed together.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:59
msgid "Play audio as Mono"
msgstr "Reproducir audio en mono"

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding the seek amount used by the "Custom value" seek step.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:74
msgid ""
"Enter the number of seconds skipped by the seek shortcuts when Custom value "
"is selected. Positive whole numbers and decimals are accepted; for example, "
"2.5."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el número de segundos que omitirán los atajos de salto cuando se "
"selecciona Valor personalizado. Se aceptan números enteros positivos y "
"decimales; por ejemplo, 2.5."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how much one press of the speed keys changes the playing speed.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:78
msgid ""
"Sets how much each Speed Up or Speed Down command changes the playback rate. "
"For example, 0.025 changes 1x speed to 1.025x."
msgstr ""
"Establece cuánto cambia la velocidad de reproducción cada comando de "
"Aumentar o Disminuir velocidad. Por ejemplo, 0.025 cambia la velocidad de 1x "
"a 1.025x."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how much one press of the pitch keys raises or lowers a sound.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:81
msgid ""
"Sets how far each Raise Pitch or Lower Pitch command moves. One semitone is "
"the distance between adjacent piano keys; 0.1 semitone is 10 cents. Enter a "
"value from 0.001 to 12."
msgstr ""
"Establece cuánto se desplaza cada comando de Aumentar o Disminuir tono. Un "
"semitono es la distancia entre teclas adyacentes de un piano; 0.1 semitonos "
"equivale a 10 centésimas. Introduce un valor de 0.001 a 12."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how much one press of the volume keys changes the loudness.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:85
msgid ""
"Sets the amount added or subtracted by each Volume Up or Volume Down "
"command. Enter a whole number from 1 to 20."
msgstr ""
"Establece la cantidad que se suma o resta con cada comando de Aumentar o "
"Disminuir volumen. Introduce un número entero del 1 al 20."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how far one press moves the sound left or right.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:88
msgid ""
"Sets how many percentage points each Pan Left or Pan Right command moves the "
"sound. Enter a whole number from 1 to 100."
msgstr ""
"Establece cuántos puntos porcentuales mueve el sonido cada comando de "
"Balance a la izquierda o Balance a la derecha. Introduce un número entero "
"del 1 al 100."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses what the player does at the end of a file.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:91
msgid ""
"Choose whether reaching the end starts the next playlist item, repeats the "
"current item, or leaves playback stopped at the end."
msgstr ""
"Elige si al llegar al final se inicia el siguiente elemento de la lista de "
"reproducción, se repite el elemento actual o se detiene la reproducción al "
"final."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that carries on from the first file after the last one.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:94
msgid ""
"With at least two items loaded, Next on the final item returns to the first "
"and Previous on the first returns to the final item. Automatic advance "
"follows the same rule."
msgstr ""
"Con al menos dos elementos cargados, Siguiente en el último elemento vuelve "
"al primero y Anterior en el primero vuelve al último. El avance automático "
"sigue la misma regla."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that remembers where each file was stopped.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:98
msgid ""
"Keeps a separate resume time for every item and returns to that time when "
"the item is opened again during navigation."
msgstr ""
"Mantiene un tiempo de reanudación independiente para cada elemento y vuelve "
"a ese punto cuando el elemento se abre de nuevo durante la navegación."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that evens out the loudness and holds back the loudest peaks.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:101
msgid ""
"Evens out changing loudness and restrains the loudest peaks to reduce "
"clipping. Clear this option to hear the source without those filters."
msgstr ""
"Empareja la sonoridad variable y frena los picos más altos para reducir la "
"distorsión. Desmarca esta opción para escuchar la fuente sin esos filtros."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that plays the left and right channels mixed together.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:104
msgid ""
"Combines the left and right channels into one mono output. Clear this option "
"to preserve the source channel layout."
msgstr ""
"Combina los canales izquierdo y derecho en una sola salida mono. Desmarca "
"esta opción para conservar la distribución de canales original."

#. Translators: Error message shown when the speed step was typed as something other than a number above zero.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:114
msgid "Speed step must be a positive number."
msgstr "El paso de velocidad debe ser un número positivo."

#. Translators: Error shown when the pitch step is not a number from 0.001 through 12.
#: UI/AudioPreferences.cs:123
msgid "Pitch step must be a number from 0.001 to 12."
msgstr "El paso de tono debe ser un número entre 0.001 y 12."

#. Translators: Title of the window listing the audio tracks in the file to switch between.
#: UI/AudioTrackDialog.cs:15
msgid "Audio Tracks"
msgstr "Pistas de audio"

#. Translators: Label above the list of audio tracks in the file to switch between.
#: UI/AudioTrackDialog.cs:19
msgid "Select audio track"
msgstr "Seleccionar pista de audio"

#. Translators: Spoken description of the backup and restore settings page, read when the page is opened.
#: UI/Backup.cs:14
msgid ""
"Save portable copies of preferences and bookmarks, restore them from earlier "
"copies, or open Luna's configuration folder."
msgstr ""
"Guarda copias portables de tus preferencias y marcadores, restablécelos "
"desde copias anteriores o abre la carpeta de configuración de Luna."

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that saves a copy of the settings to a file the user chooses.
#: UI/Backup.cs:20 UI/Backup.cs:56 UI/Backup.cs:60
msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Exportar configuración"

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that loads settings back from a file the user chooses.
#: UI/Backup.cs:22 UI/Backup.cs:69 UI/Backup.cs:82
msgid "Import settings"
msgstr "Importar configuración"

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that saves a copy of the bookmarks to a file the user chooses.
#: UI/Backup.cs:24 UI/Backup.cs:88 UI/Backup.cs:92
msgid "Export bookmarks"
msgstr "Exportar marcadores"

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that loads bookmarks back from a file the user chooses.
#: UI/Backup.cs:26 UI/Backup.cs:99 UI/Backup.cs:103
msgid "Import bookmarks"
msgstr "Importar marcadores"

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that puts every setting back the way it started.
#: UI/Backup.cs:28 UI/Backup.cs:112 UI/Backup.cs:124
msgid "Reset settings"
msgstr "Restablecer configuración"

#. Translators: Button on the backup and restore settings page that opens the folder where the player keeps its settings.
#: UI/Backup.cs:30
msgid "Open user settings folder"
msgstr "Abrir carpeta de configuración del usuario"

#. Translators: Help text for the button that saves a copy of the settings, spoken when the user asks for help on it.
#: UI/Backup.cs:39
msgid ""
"Saves the current preferences to a JSON file you choose while leaving Luna's "
"working copy in place."
msgstr ""
"Guarda las preferencias actuales en el archivo JSON que elijas sin modificar "
"la copia de trabajo de Luna."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that loads settings back from a file, spoken when the user asks for help on it.
#: UI/Backup.cs:41
msgid ""
"Loads preferences from a JSON file and replaces the values currently shown "
"in this dialog."
msgstr ""
"Carga las preferencias desde un archivo JSON y reemplaza los valores "
"mostrados actualmente en este diálogo."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that saves a copy of the bookmarks, spoken when the user asks for help on it. JSON is the file format and is not translated.
#: UI/Backup.cs:43
msgid ""
"Saves all bookmarks to a JSON file you choose without moving or deleting the "
"working copy."
msgstr ""
"Guarda todos los marcadores en el archivo JSON que elijas sin mover ni "
"eliminar la copia de trabajo."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that loads bookmarks back from a file, spoken when the user asks for help on it.
#: UI/Backup.cs:45
msgid ""
"Loads bookmarks from a JSON file and replaces the collection Luna currently "
"uses."
msgstr ""
"Carga los marcadores desde un archivo JSON y reemplaza la colección que Luna "
"usa actualmente."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that puts every setting back the way it started, spoken when the user asks for help on it.
#: UI/Backup.cs:47
msgid ""
"Returns every preference to its original value after you confirm. This "
"cannot be undone from the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve cada preferencia a su valor original tras confirmar. Esto no se "
"puede deshacer desde el diálogo."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that opens the folder where the player keeps its settings, spoken when the user asks for help on it.
#: UI/Backup.cs:49
msgid ""
"Opens Luna's configuration directory in File Explorer so you can inspect or "
"copy its files directly."
msgstr ""
"Abre el directorio de configuración de Luna en el Explorador de archivos "
"para que puedas inspeccionar o copiar sus archivos directamente."

#. Translators: Message shown once the settings have been saved to the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:60
msgid "Settings exported successfully."
msgstr "Configuración exportada con éxito."

#. Translators: Message shown when the settings could not be saved to the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:62
msgid "Could not export settings."
msgstr "No se pudo exportar la configuración."

#. Translators: Title of the message shown when the settings could not be saved to the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:64 UI/Backup.cs:94
msgid "Export error"
msgstr "Error de exportación"

#. Translators: Message shown when the chosen file does not hold settings the player can read.
#: UI/Backup.cs:75
msgid "The selected settings file is invalid or could not be imported."
msgstr ""
"El archivo de configuración seleccionado no es válido o no se pudo importar."

#. Translators: Title of the message shown when settings could not be loaded from the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:77 UI/Backup.cs:82 UI/Backup.cs:105
msgid "Import error"
msgstr "Error de importación"

#. Translators: Message shown once settings have been loaded from the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:82
msgid "Settings imported successfully."
msgstr "Configuración importada con éxito."

#. Translators: Message shown once the bookmarks have been saved to the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:92
msgid "Bookmarks exported successfully."
msgstr "Marcadores exportados con éxito."

#. Translators: Message shown when the bookmarks could not be saved to the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:94
msgid "Could not export bookmarks."
msgstr "No se pudieron exportar los marcadores."

#. Translators: Message shown once bookmarks have been loaded from the chosen file.
#: UI/Backup.cs:103
msgid "Bookmarks imported successfully."
msgstr "Marcadores importados con éxito."

#. Translators: Message shown when the chosen file does not hold bookmarks the player can read.
#: UI/Backup.cs:105
msgid "The selected bookmarks file is invalid or could not be imported."
msgstr ""
"El archivo de marcadores seleccionado no es válido o no se pudo importar."

#. Translators: Question asked before every setting is put back the way it started.
#: UI/Backup.cs:111
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset all settings to defaults?\n"
"This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"¿Estás seguro de que deseas restablecer toda la configuración a los valores "
"predeterminados?\n"
"Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

#. Translators: Message shown when the settings could not be put back the way they started.
#: UI/Backup.cs:117
msgid "Could not reset settings."
msgstr "No se pudo restablecer la configuración."

#. Translators: Title of the message shown when the settings could not be put back the way they started.
#: UI/Backup.cs:119 UI/Backup.cs:124
msgid "Reset error"
msgstr "Error al restablecer"

#. Translators: Message shown once every setting has been put back the way it started.
#: UI/Backup.cs:124
msgid "Settings were reset to defaults."
msgstr "La configuración se restableció a los valores predeterminados."

#. Translators: Message shown when the folder holding the player's settings could not be opened.
#: UI/Backup.cs:131
msgid "Could not open the settings folder."
msgstr "No se pudo abrir la carpeta de configuración."

#. Translators: Title of the message shown when the folder holding the player's settings could not be opened.
#: UI/Backup.cs:133
msgid "Open folder error"
msgstr "Error al abrir la carpeta"

#. Translators: The file types offered when saving a copy of the settings or bookmarks. Translate only
#. the two names, "JSON files" and "All files"; leave everything else, including the vertical bars, as it is.
#: UI/Backup.cs:140 UI/Backup.cs:147
msgid "JSON files (*.json)|*.json|All files (*.*)|*.*"
msgstr "Archivos JSON (*.json)|*.json|Todos los archivos (*.*)|*.*"

