#. Translators: The converter's progress. {number} is the file's place, {total} how many files
#. there are, {name} the file being converted right now.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:152
msgid "Converting file {number} of {total}: {name}"
msgstr "Convirtiendo archivo {number} de {total}: {name}"

#. Translators: How far the file being converted right now has got. {percent} is a whole number.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:155
msgid "Percentage: {percent}%"
msgstr "Porcentaje: {percent}%"

#. Translators: How many files have not been converted yet. {count} is a whole number.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:157
msgid "Remaining files: {count}"
msgstr "Archivos restantes: {count}"

#. Translators: A guess at the time left. {time} is a clock such as 3:20 or 1:05:00, or the word
#. for a guess not yet worth making.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:160
msgid "Estimated time left: {time}"
msgstr "Tiempo restante estimado: {time}"

#. Translators: Shown for the estimated time left before enough is done to guess it.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:164
msgid "calculating…"
msgstr "calculando…"

#. Translators: How far the whole batch has got. {percent} is a whole number.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:166
msgid "Total percentage: {percent}%"
msgstr "Porcentaje total: {percent}%"

#. Translators: Asks the user to confirm stopping a conversion that is still running.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:178
msgid "The conversion is still running. Would you like to stop it?"
msgstr "La conversión aún está en ejecución. ¿Deseas detenerla?"

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while files are being converted.
#: UI/ConversionProgressDialog.cs:235
msgid "Converting files"
msgstr "Convirtiendo archivos"

#. Translators: Label of the box listing the files a conversion could not convert.
#: UI/ConversionReportDialog.cs:18
