msgstr "Detalles"

#. Translators: Title of the window shown when the player has hit an error it cannot carry on from.
#: UI/CrashDialog.cs:30 UI/CrashDialog.cs:81
msgid "Something went wrong"
msgstr "Algo salió mal"

#. Translators: Message at the top of the crash window. The player carries on where it can, so this
#. says what happened rather than announcing that it is closing.
#: UI/CrashDialog.cs:35
msgid ""
"Luna hit an unexpected error it could not deal with. Please copy the details "
"below and send them to the developer."
msgstr ""
"Luna encontró un error inesperado que no pudo gestionar. Por favor, copia "
"los detalles a continuación y envíalos al desarrollador."

#. Translators: Tells the user where the crash details have also been written. {path} is a file name.
#: UI/CrashDialog.cs:42
msgid "This has also been written to {path}"
msgstr "Esto también se ha guardado en {path}"

#. Translators: Button on the crash window that puts the details on the clipboard.
#: UI/CrashDialog.cs:45
msgid "Copy details"
msgstr "Copiar detalles"

#. Translators: Shown when the crash details could not be put on the clipboard. The file named
#. on the window still has them.
#: UI/CrashDialog.cs:79
msgid "The details could not be copied. They are in the file named above."
msgstr ""
"No se pudieron copiar los detalles. Están en el archivo indicado arriba."

#. Translators: Label of the list for choosing which preset a preset being edited starts out from.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:79
msgid "Base preset"
msgstr "Ajuste preestablecido base"

#. Translators: Button in the equalizer editor that puts every band back the way the chosen base preset ships.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:106
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Restablecer a valores predeterminados"

#. Translators: Button in the equalizer editor that keeps the changes.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:111
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding the centre frequency of one equalizer band, in hertz.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:152
msgid "Frequency (Hz)"
msgstr "Frecuencia (Hz)"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how far one equalizer band lifts or cuts, in decibels.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:158
msgid "Gain (dB)"
msgstr "Ganancia (dB)"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how wide one equalizer band is. Q is the usual name for it and is normally left as it is.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:161
msgid "Q (width)"
msgstr "Q (ancho de banda)"

#. Translators: Title of the group of settings for the equalizer band that lifts or cuts everything below a frequency.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:185
msgid "Low shelf"
msgstr "Filtro de estante bajo"

#. Translators: Title of the group of settings for the equalizer band that lifts or cuts everything above a frequency.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:187
msgid "High shelf"
msgstr "Filtro de estante alto"

#. Translators: Title of the group of settings for one equalizer band. {frequency} is the band's frequency in hertz, such as 250.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:189
msgid "{frequency} Hz"
msgstr "{frequency} Hz"

#. Translators: Shown when the user saves an equalizer preset without giving it a name.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:234
msgid "Enter a name for the preset."
msgstr "Introduce un nombre para el ajuste preestablecido."

#. Translators: Shown when a gain typed into the equalizer editor is not a number or is out of range. {band} names the band, such as "250 Hz"; {minimum} and {maximum} are the smallest and largest allowed.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:268
msgid ""
"The gain for {band} must be a number between {minimum} and {maximum} "
"decibels."
msgstr ""
"La ganancia para {band} debe ser un número entre {minimum} y {maximum} "
"decibelios."

#. Translators: Shown when a Q typed into the equalizer editor is not a number or is out of range. {band} names the band, such as "250 Hz"; {minimum} and {maximum} are the smallest and largest allowed. Q is the usual name for a band's width.
#: UI/Equalizer/EditDialog.cs:278
msgid "The Q for {band} must be a number between {minimum} and {maximum}."
msgstr "El valor Q para {band} debe ser un número entre {minimum} y {maximum}."

